SURVIVED e3d6_01_zero_prize_counts_as_a_loss_in_the_mixed_test.py: A zero prize with positive probability counts as a loss in the mixed-sign test, so a set whose only gain is paired with a sure zero prize passes the mixed-sign condition. -> None
SURVIVED e3d6_02_mixed_check_reads_only_the_chosen_lottery.py: The mixed-sign condition looks only at the lottery each participant chose, so a mixed lottery that was not chosen does not count. -> None
KILLED e3d6_03_loss_inverse_divides_after_the_power.py: The prospect certainty equivalent of a negative lottery value divides by lambda after the power, not before it, so the loss branch is wrong whenever lambda is not 1. -> test_prospect_matches_oracle_for_instance_lotteries (seed 0)
